.Dd March 31, 2025
.Dt JSON_TOSA 3
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm json_tosa
.Nd serialize a JSON value into a stralloc buffer
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In json.h
.Ft void
.Fn json_tosa "jsonval val" "stralloc *sa" "json_print_fn *p"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Fn json_tosa
function serializes the JSON value
.Fa val
and appends or writes the resulting representation into the dynamic string allocation structure
.Fa sa .
The formatting function
.Fa p
controls output styling (or
.Dv NULL
for defaults).
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr json_print 3